    "title": "Weston McKennie's pre-game ritual is a whole production - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Gesi Lloyd ,\n7 hours ago Weston McKennie has never been shy about doing things his own way, whether that means a multi step beauty routine before kickoff or standing on bleachers to heckle his teammates during media availabilities. As the USMNT midfielder heads deeper into the World Cup, both sides of his personality have become central to how the team operates on and off the field. Read full article",
